title: "@three-ws/brain-mcp"
abstract: "Any model, one interface: the three.ws multi-provider LLM router over MCP. Discover available providers/models (Claude, GPT-5, Grok, Qwen, DeepSeek, NVIDIA Nemotron, IBM Granite and more) and run a chat completion through whichever one fits. Free tiers need no key; paid flagships unlock with a three.ws API key."
